WEBVTT

00:00:59.676 --> 00:01:00.876
WPR: I love that,

00:01:00.876 --> 00:01:03.676
and I feel like that's going to give us
so much perspective

00:01:03.676 --> 00:01:04.876
during this conversation.

00:01:04.916 --> 00:01:06.236
Let’s just dive right in.

00:01:06.236 --> 00:01:08.756
I think one place we'd like
to start with is in Iran.

00:01:08.796 --> 00:01:11.796
For those of you who are on the call
who haven't been tracking,

00:01:11.796 --> 00:01:14.116
back in September,
an Iranian woman, Mahsa Amini,

00:01:14.116 --> 00:01:16.276
died in the custody
of Iranian morality police

00:01:16.316 --> 00:01:18.356
after being arrested
for not wearing hijab.

00:01:18.396 --> 00:01:20.596
Amini's death sparked protests
and a revolution

00:01:20.596 --> 00:01:22.596
around women's rights in Iran and beyond

00:01:22.636 --> 00:01:24.596
that is continuing into this very moment.

00:01:24.596 --> 00:01:25.796
And, Christiane,

00:01:25.796 --> 00:01:29.156
I know that you've reported
on Iran throughout your career

00:01:29.156 --> 00:01:33.476
and have spent a lot of time covering
this story very closely.